{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find your way down the mountain by walking, jumping, and falling through a series of strange worlds, cultures, media, and other nouns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Down You Go</strong> is a challenging platformer about an obese man attempting to get off of a mountain top. He can only walk, jump, and on occasion, bunny hop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whilst you descend, enjoy:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The ever-changing environment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>You will fall through the culture of Japan, the junk food of America, and other nouns.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hours of gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>As the developer I find I usually complete this game in around 30 minutes, I fear it may take you much longer.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No enemies. No checkpoints.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Just gravity, and your many mistakes.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Simple controls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Move, jump, regret.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Completely non-violent.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Other than what you may do to your computer.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876910/extras/b27b2d38e374bc685abb381647a88d9d.avif?t=1752756858\" /></div></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3876910?t=1752756858","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876910/61070f9b986f9ac87a52791700fd2f84e2c6d5cb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752756858","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876910/98f1b8b443da0586b0aeaa7f0170aaaa1673f41a/capsul